From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Microsandbox <development@superrad.company>
Date: Tue, 16 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 24/24] virtio: add microsandbox upper metrics driver

Add a small built-in virtio driver for microsandbox's private metrics
device. The driver lets PID 1 register the mounted OCI upper filesystem
path through a write-once sysfs knob, pins the resolved path, samples
VFS statfs accounting, and publishes fixed-size upper used/free samples
to the host over the private virtqueue.

The path registration is intentionally write-once. If a workload later
obtains guest root, it cannot retarget the reporter to a different mount
through this knob; it can only affect the metric by actually changing the
registered filesystem's usage.

Signed-off-by: Microsandbox <development@superrad.company>
---
 drivers/virtio/Kconfig             |  10 ++
 drivers/virtio/Makefile            |   1 +
 drivers/virtio/virtio_msb_metrics.c | 291 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 include/uapi/linux/virtio_ids.h    |   1 +
 4 files changed, 303 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 drivers/virtio/virtio_msb_metrics.c

